    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d55">

                <pb facs="0109" n="62" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v03mSupp/pg62"/>

                <head>55. Telegram 389 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d55-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1955-08-10">August 10, 1955, 5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d55-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d55-1"/>
                <p>389. From Johnson.</p>
                <p>Desire call attention FBIS item 091427 Peking International English Service. This
                    probably forecasts line Wang will take
                    when “no force” reached and to which reply some kind will be required.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>NOTE: Mr. Waddell’s office (FE) notified 8/10/55 4:37 p.m. EMB CWO</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
